  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kuwait, like many other countries in the region, faces significant challenges in balancing economic growth and economic diversification with environmental sustainability. In Kuwait, enterprises face institutional, regulatory and policy challenges that may hinder their ability to contribute to a low carbon economy. Within this aim, ILO is supporting Kuwait Chamber of Commerce and Industry to build its capacity to identify policy options and drafting position papers to advocate for a greener business environment where Kuwaiti companies can thrive and contribute to national climate goals.</narrative>
  </description>
